{"type": "vertex_text", "round": 1, "text": "I have reviewed the gate report and the application files. The report identifies two issues: the use of terms not explicitly found in the inventor's disclosure, and an inaccurate description of FIG. 2 in the Brief Description of the Drawings.\n\nTo address the first finding, I will add definitional text to the detailed description where the terms 'exposed face', 'bearing face', and 'clearance' are first introduced. This will formally ground these necessary terms in the disclosed concepts, as suggested by the report, without altering the substance of the invention.\n\nTo address the second finding, I will amend the description of FIG. 2 to remove the assertion that the chamber, an empty space, is shown in section. The corrected text will accurately state that the solid parts bounding the chamber are shown in section, which aligns with the authoritative figure brief and standard drafting practice.\n\nThese changes will be made via specific patches to `draft/08-detailed-description.md` and `draft/07-drawings.md`. No other files require modification."}
